  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "With the new Live Now overhaul, current and upcoming events are seemingly removed/not prioritized. Now events are only shown in the \"Coming Up Tonight\" section which limits upcoming events to the current day OR the \"Event\" indicator of a instance.\n\nThere is now no good way to organically view current and upcoming events and by category within the client, as the Calendar tab only shows joined group events & and the Search tab for events is utterly junk & useless (as is discovery on VRChat as a whole).\n\nI understand that goal for the Live Now overhaul was to actually focus on the \"Live Now\" aspect, but now event discovery has worsened without any alternative.",
